<h3><u>Yeh Karbala hai</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Allahumm-ar-zuqna ziyarat al hussain..(2)<br />
Fi fuaadi karbala, wan-nidai karbala<br />
Karbala awaaz meri, dil mera hai karbala<br />
karbala, karbala, karbala..(6)</p>

<p>Yaha&#39;n sambhal kar qadam uthana<br />
yeh karbala hai, yeh karbala hai..(2)</p>

<p>Yeh baat hargiz na bhul jaana<br />
yeh karbala hai, yeh karbala hai<br />
Karbala karabala karbala</p>

<p>1. Jahan e sabr o reza yehi hai<br />
nida e&nbsp; sabr o reza yehi hai<br />
yaha&#39;n pe aake hai chalke Mehdi(a.t.f.s)<br />
Behisht e zahra ye sar zamee&#39;n hai<br />
yaha&#39;n hai zahra ka aana jana</p>

<p>yeh karbala hai, yeh karbala hai</p>

<p>2. Duaein denge hussain tumko<br />
yaha&#39;n pe aansu agar bahaye<br />
yaha&#39;n pe beti ne bewatan ki<br />
sitamgaro se tamache khaye<br />
yaha&#39;n pe khushiyo ko bhul jaana</p>

<p>yeh karbala hai, yeh karbala hai</p>

<p>3. Yaha&#39;n pe guzri hai wo qayamat<br />
mila na usko sukoon ab tak<br />
ridaein chinne ke ghum mein abid<br />
lahad mein rota hai khoon ab tak<br />
yaha&#39;n pe hargiz na muskurana</p>

<p>yeh karbala hai, yeh karbala hai</p>

<p>4. Yaha&#39;n pe hurr bhi tha hurmala bhi<br />
kitabe hasti ko padhke dekho<br />
sada e halmin jo aa rahi hai<br />
tum is taraf ho ya us taraf ho<br />
tumhe amal se hai ab batana</p>

<p>yeh karbala hai, yeh karbala hai</p>

<p>5. Kahi&#39;n pe qasim hue hai tukde<br />
kahi&#39;n pe zee&#39;n se gire the maula<br />
kahi&#39;n sakina sumo se lipti<br />
kahi&#39;n pe asghar ne teer khaya<br />
yahi&#39;n ghareebi ka hai thikana</p>

<p>yeh karbala hai, yeh karbala hai</p>

<p>6. Sawari aayegi ek waha&#39;n se<br />
najaf ki janib nigaah rakhna<br />
jab aaye shame ghariba&#39;n jis dum<br />
ali ko zainab ka pursa dena<br />
tum aansuo ke diye jalana</p>

<p>yeh karbala hai, yeh karbala hai</p>

<p>7. Kisi ke dil mein lagi hai barchi<br />
kisi ke baazu kate yehi par<br />
haye ali ki beti ke kitne yusuf<br />
lahu mein doobe hai is zamee&#39;n par<br />
luta hai sadaat ka gharana</p>

<p>yeh karbala hai, yeh karbala hai</p>

<p>8. Rahe kahi&#39;n bhi jaha&#39;n mein jakar<br />
hussain wale ye jaante hai<br />
hum ehle matam ke dil takallum<br />
yaha&#39;n ki mitti se hi bane hai<br />
yaha&#39;n hai wapas palatke aana</p>

<p>yeh karbala hai, yeh karbala hai</p>
</p>
